data: {"id": "8826d7177e4e4b6a-thinking-parallel_evidence-1169", "run_id": "8826d7177e4e4b6a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我已有所有关键 Kubernetes 事实，让我分析证据：\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod YAML 关键事实\n- **deletionTimestamp**: `2026-09-07T23:09:46Z`（已设置删除时间戳）\n- **metadata.finalizers**: `[\"aiops.lab/hold\"]`（存在自定义 finalizer，这是关键！）\n- **deletionGracePeriodSeconds**: `0`\n- **terminationGracePeriodSeconds**: `10`\n- **nodeName**: `node2`\n- **phase**: `Running`（但 status 标注为 Terminating 36 分钟）\n- **容器状态**: `app` container ready=False, restarts=0, reason=Error, exitCode=137\n\n### 2. Describe 事件关键事实\n- **Killing 事件**: `Stopping container app` 发", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788824775425, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

